Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.49,0:03:34.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\blur1.8\1a&H4C&\c&H000000&\pos(964.5,147)}December 7th, 2025\N— In GGO{\fnKozuka Mincho Pro Strp}・{\fn}Wasteland Field —
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.97,0:03:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Dine, you sure you got the right info?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.85,0:03:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they coming or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.31,0:03:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.05,0:04:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I checked the route myself, so relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.17,0:04:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet they're busy clearing\Nsome big-ass monster spawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.73,0:04:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means your cut will be bigger\Nthis time, so no complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.81,0:04:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, no one's complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.49,0:04:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we're talking about it, ain't\Nthese the same jokers we hit last week?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.23,0:04:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could have wised up to\Nus and changed their route.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that squad does is hunt monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.61,0:04:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't care how many\Ntimes they get attacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.63,0:04:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because they'll just make up\Nfor it on their next hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.19,0:04:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For player-hunter squads like\Nus, they make the perfect target.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.97,0:04:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They move by algorithm,\Njust like the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.01,0:04:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I'm concerned, they're chumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.31,0:04:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.73,0:04:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for weapons, they're geared up with\Noptical guns for hunting monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.63,0:04:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we've got defense shields, so as\Nlong as those are up, it's easy pickings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what if they got smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.69,0:04:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like, what if they're\Nready for us this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.91,0:04:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hit them not too long ago, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt they got their hands on\Nenough live ammo guns that fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.15,0:04:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By now, they might have one firearm\Nfor support, but that's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.91,0:05:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, we got the best\Nsniper in GGO watching our backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.53,0:05:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got all our bases covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.63,0:05:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Sinon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.77,0:05:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.07,0:05:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I can't argue with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.95,0:05:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a crack shot like Sinon up\Nhere, things are looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's better than good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.85,0:05:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.05,0:05:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a big if, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.69,0:05:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she missed, I'd be cool with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.39,0:05:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take them about a minute to\Nfigure out where the shot came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While they're doing that,\NI'll be in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.41,0:05:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll hose them down and rake in the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.29,0:05:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.75,0:05:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, doll face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.11,0:05:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering, what\Nyou doing after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found a gun shop with\Nan awesome inventory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we could go get some tea\Nor maybe do something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.19,0:05:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.03,0:06:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you mean, January.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, there's stuff I\Nhave to do when I log out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, doll face. What's the stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.99,0:06:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you still in school?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.59,0:06:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's kind of hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.75,0:06:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a report, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.13,0:06:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lay off her, January.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.55,0:06:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't put her on the spot like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.31,0:06:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're working, so don't\Nbring up the real world here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.19,0:06:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ain't the time or place\Nto respect your solo status.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like, you guys can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.97,0:06:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When's the last time\Neither of you got lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.39,0:06:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last night with your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.79,0:06:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off. Stay sharp. Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.87,0:06:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About time they showed up to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.85,0:06:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, it's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.21,0:06:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four, five, six, seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.69,0:06:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one more than last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got four optical blasters in the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.71,0:07:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see one large-caliber laser rifle,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.13,0:07:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not a problem, and a guy with\Na mini-me, he goes down first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.91,0:07:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The new guy in the back, he's got a\Ncloak on, can't see what he's carrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.87,0:07:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's wearing a cloak? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.47,0:07:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's him, that death gun\Nguy everyone's talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.15,0:07:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, you believe in fairy tales now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.27,0:07:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks like he's strength-filled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.19,0:07:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably just a courier, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.09,0:07:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything, I bet he's carrying the\Nsquad's ammo, energy packs, and drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.59,0:07:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, we can ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.31,0:07:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a bad vibe\Nfrom the guy in back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should take him out\Nbefore anyone else. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not carrying any weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.85,0:07:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he is, maybe he isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.85,0:08:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an unknown, so he's a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear what you're saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's also a mini-me out\Nthere, and that's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.15,0:08:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he starts lighting us up and those\Nblasters move in, it's gonna get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.81,0:08:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll drop the guy with the mini-me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my second bullet's got Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.11,0:08:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cloak's name on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hate to interrupt you guys,\Nbut they're closing on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're at 2,500 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.15,0:08:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.06,0:08:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna stick with\Nthe original plan and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait for him in the\Nshadow of that building.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.05,0:08:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sinon, call out if the situation changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for my order to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.29,0:08:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.29,0:08:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.85,0:09:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in position. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.19,0:09:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Targets haven't changed\Ntheir course or their speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.05,0:09:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're 400 meters from you,\N1,500 from me. Pretty far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.53,0:09:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you make the shot? No sweat.\NOkay, then. Fire when ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Xenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.55,0:09:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.69,0:09:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This pressure, this anxiety, this fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.13,0:09:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,1500 meters that's nothing like tossing a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.55,0:09:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lot of paper into a trash can no way this\Nis nothing like how it felt that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.83,0:10:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.53,0:10:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't change position.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.71,0:10:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cleared the first target, but\NI couldn't pop the second one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.23,0:10:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.33,0:10:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sit tight up there, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.69,0:10:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.71,0:10:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a minigun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.17,0:11:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not late because\Ntheir hunt was running long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.43,0:11:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're moving slow in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.29,0:11:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the weight of that\Nminigun had a movement penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.31,0:11:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.43,0:11:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Score!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.13,0:11:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.04,0:11:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.96,0:11:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This op's gonna be a cakewalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.31,0:12:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.27,0:12:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he can smile in the middle of a\Nfirefight, he must be pretty brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.55,0:12:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.45,0:12:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, he's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.27,0:12:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.17,0:12:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.55,0:12:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.46,0:12:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.89,0:13:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta find some cover, but where?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.31,0:13:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where, damn it, where? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,S-Sinon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.37,0:13:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sinon, are you hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.93,0:13:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastards, they teamed up\Nwith a freaking bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.07,0:13:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bodyguard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that guy with the minigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.43,0:13:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a macho prick,\Ncalls himself behemoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.37,0:13:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we can't keep sitting here\Ncause they're gonna wipe us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That minigun's only got\Nso much ammo to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.97,0:13:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we attack him at once, he'll panic\Nand burn through the rest of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.67,0:13:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jin and Miss, you take the left flank.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dyne and I'll come in from the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.65,0:14:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arashi, you stay here and cover us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.75,0:14:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.23,0:14:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the three guys out\Nthere carrying the blasters?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.39,0:14:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we rush them, our\Ndefense shields aren't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.01,0:14:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, but their blasters can't\Nfire as fast as a live ammo gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.47,0:14:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can just dodge them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.77,0:14:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.68,0:14:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we go charging out there, that\Nminigun will turn us into confetti!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.15,0:14:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but we're packing it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.23,0:14:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's better if we log out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.51,0:14:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least we'll be able to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.87,0:14:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.78,0:14:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't get away from\Nthings by logging out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.35,0:14:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a game, for Christ's sakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.01,0:14:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.92,0:14:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we charge them, we just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.53,0:14:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then die! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.77,0:14:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a game,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.68,0:14:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you can at least have the balls to\Nface death here instead of whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.37,0:14:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can distract a minigun for\Nthree seconds, I can take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:14:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.97,0:15:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll split up and attack\Nhim from both sides, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.87,0:15:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.03,0:15:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die! Cover me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.09,0:16:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you like that, punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.79,0:16:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.93,0:16:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.93,0:16:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice going.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.65,0:17:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I've got to figure out how\Nto get into Behemoth's blind spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.61,0:17:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better move fast, or he's going\Nto get a beat on my location.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.53,0:17:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bullets are flying, and he's\Ngot the guts to smile like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.23,0:17:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I will, too, when I kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.35,0:17:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.81,0:17:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Lord, I'm so perfect for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, truthfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use me to upset you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.15,0:17:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.19,0:18:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.51,0:18:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.11,0:19:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.01,0:19:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.95,0:19:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.73,0:20:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a new trick up my sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.35,0:20:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please all help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.07,0:20:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.05,0:20:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.07,0:20:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.05,0:20:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.87,0:20:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me that's the last of it. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.97,0:20:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I pretty much got\Neverything I need now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to keep going some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.01,0:20:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always hook us up at your shop, so\Nif you need more, we don't mind helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.95,0:20:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.85,0:21:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, hmm, we sort of picked\Nthis place clean, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.53,0:21:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take a break and let them respawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.69,0:21:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.37,0:21:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're so into each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair, damn it. How now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.07,0:21:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, doesn't matter if\Nthey're at school or here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.03,0:21:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't keep their\Nhands off each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.17,0:21:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean they're like this at school, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.81,0:21:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All day, every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.69,0:22:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, there's something important\NI've been wanting to tell you.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.49,0:22:13.29,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k87\fad(200,200)}Mo{\k41}tto {\k48}tsu{\k23}yo{\k82}ku {\k34}sou {\k41}tsu{\k22}yo{\k87}ku {\k25}na{\k44}ri{\k25}ta{\k42}i {\k48}to {\k43}ne{\k46}ga{\k42}tta
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.49,0:22:13.29,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I wished so hard to become stronger than ever
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.29,0:22:17.21,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k26\fad(200,200)}Ka{\k18}na{\k26}shi{\k47}mi {\k20}wo {\k45}ko{\k45}e{\k165}te
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.29,0:22:17.21,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Overcoming my grief
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.81,0:22:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been able to change my life
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.42,0:22:27.97,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k28\fad(200,200)}Ka{\k45}wa{\k22}ru {\k46}ko{\k44}to {\k42}nai {\k24}ka{\k23}ko {\k81}ni
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.42,0:22:27.97,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I've turned my back so many times
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.97,0:22:31.60,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k33\fad(200,200)}Na{\k45}n{\k22}do {\k38}mo {\k51}se {\k42}wo {\k23}mu{\k21}ke{\k47}te{\k41}ta
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.97,0:22:31.60,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}On the past that will never change
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.07,0:22:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been able to see myself
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.60,0:22:38.98,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k27\fad(200,200)}Da{\k44}re {\k22}ni {\k48}mo {\k42}mi{\k48}se{\k22}ra{\k19}re {\k47}nai {\k16}ki{\k30}zu {\k44}wo {\k21}ka{\k17}ku{\k51}shi{\k21}ta {\k26}ma{\k37}ma {\k49}zu{\k107}tto
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.60,0:22:38.98,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}While hiding the scars I can never show anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.07,0:22:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen my eyes. I've never been
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.95,0:22:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Able to see my pain, I've never been.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.98,0:22:46.11,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k23\fad(200,200)}A{\k30}fu{\k22}re {\k16}da{\k24}shi{\k24}ta {\k24}ko{\k22}no {\k23}i{\k24}ta{\k23}mi {\k99}wa {\k32}su{\k19}be{\k18}te {\k30}hi{\k23}to{\k21}ri {\k24}de {\k20}da{\k16}ki {\k30}shi{\k26}me{\k100}ru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.98,0:22:46.11,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I will embrace all this pain that has started flooding through me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.59,0:22:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To see my pain, I'm all alone and I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.73,0:22:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,able to touch my heart I need nothing more
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.11,0:22:49.07,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k32\fad(200,200)}It{\k22}su{\k21}ka {\k24}ki{\k23}e{\k21}ru {\k22}nu{\k23}ku{\k26}mo{\k20}ri {\k22}na{\k40}ra
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.11,0:22:49.07,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I don't need warmth at all
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.07,0:22:53.70,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k24\fad(200,200)}Hi{\k21}to{\k26}tsu {\k46}mo {\k24}i{\k41}ra{\k44}nai {\k237}yo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.07,0:22:53.70,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}If it will vanish one day
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.45,0:22:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to be strong and strong.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.70,0:23:01.63,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k98\fad(200,200)}Mo{\k46}tto {\k44}tsu{\k23}yo{\k88}ku {\k29}sou {\k40}tsu{\k22}yo{\k91}ku {\k21}na{\k44}ri{\k25}ta{\k45}i {\k44}to {\k45}ne{\k44}ga{\k44}tta
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.70,0:23:01.63,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I wished so hard to become stronger than ever
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.05,0:23:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be strong and strong. I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.39,0:23:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be dark and dark As
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.63,0:23:08.05,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k23\fad(200,200)}Ku{\k21}ra{\k21}ya{\k48}mi {\k22}wo {\k43}ka{\k48}ke{\k131}ru {\k26}ko{\k20}do{\k23}ku {\k43}na {\k21}ho{\k48}shi {\k20}no {\k25}you {\k59}ni
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.63,0:23:08.05,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Like a lonely star racing across the darkness
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.05,0:23:15.81,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k53\fad(200,200)}Ko{\k45}ko{\k44}ro {\k45}fu{\k22}ka{\k86}ku {\k30}shi{\k43}zu{\k22}me{\k89}ta {\k21}yo{\k44}wa{\k24}ku{\k44}te {\k46}mo{\k44}roi {\k25}ji{\k49}bun
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.05,0:23:15.81,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sunk so deep inside my heart, I'm so weak and fragile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.61,0:23:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be deep in my heart I want to be strong\Nand strong I want to be strong and strong
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.81,0:23:22.90,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k38\fad(200,200)}Ko{\k26}to{\k19}ba {\k46}ni {\k20}de{\k47}ki{\k32}na{\k11}ku{\k134}te {\k25}ko{\k25}e {\k18}ni {\k46}mo {\k21}na{\k46}ra{\k24}na{\k16}ku{\k115}te
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.81,0:23:22.90,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I can't put it into words, or even speak out
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.90,0:23:27.94,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k68\fad(200,200)}Ki{\k22}tto {\k34}da{\k31}re {\k26}ni {\k30}mo {\k35}mi{\k23}tsu{\k39}ka{\k29}ra {\k23}na{\k34}i {\k32}yo{\k24}u {\k54}ni
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.90,0:23:27.94,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm just waiting for the light
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.94,0:23:33.66,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\k34\fad(200,400)}Ta{\k64}da {\k17}hik{\k56}ari {\k26}wo {\k42}ma{\k20}tte{\k313}ru
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.94,0:23:33.66,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)}Trying not to be found by anyone
